{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38005","headline":"病中初闻复官二首 二 · 韩偓","name":"病中初闻复官二首 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"又挂朝衣一自惊，始知天意重推诚。\n青云有路通还去，白发无私健亦生。\n曾避暖池将浴凤，却同寒谷乍迁莺。\n宦途巇嶮终难测，稳泊渔舟隐姓名。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韩偓","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_38005.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38005","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}